  #line-at(313.2pt, 117.24pt, "Together with all input/outputs, the DMX and PC respectively ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 128.76pt, "consist of 298 and 617 JJs. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.941pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(313.2pt, 143.28pt, "B. Experimental Setups ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.941pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(320.4pt, 157.68pt, "Initial prescreening and testing of all structures and circuits ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 169.2pt, "was performed in liquid helium at 4.2 K, with chips mounted ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 180.72pt, "in a flip-chip immersion cryoprobe using controlled torque to ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 192.24pt, "make simultaneous contact to all chip input/output lines. ")
  #line-at(320.4pt, 203.76pt, "Both analog and digital PCMs were then tested in ADR at ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 215.28pt, "temperatures from 100 mK to 4.2 K with steps of 100 mK, ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 226.68pt, "using a thermometer located very near the chips under test. ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 238.2pt, "This ADR of base temperature of ~80 mK was manufactured ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 249.72pt, "by HPD/FormFactor with a custom-made sample mount ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 261.24pt, "closely mimicking that of the flip-chip cryoprobe. The chip ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 272.76pt, "temperature was PID controlled by applying current through ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 284.28pt, "the ADR magnet with accuracy of ~20 mK at temperatures ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 295.68pt, "below 3.5 K and ~100 mK above it, due to more sparse ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 307.2pt, "calibration of the thermometer at higher temperatures.  ")
  #line-at(320.4pt, 318.72pt, "Measurements of more complex ERSFQ circuits, i.e., ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 330.24pt, "demultiplexers and counters, were performed in a BlueFors ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 341.76pt, "LD400 DR at temperatures of ~10 mK.  ")
  #line-at(320.4pt, 353.16pt, "All experimental setups (immersion cryoprobe, ADR, and ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 364.68pt, "DR) employed multilayer concentric mu-metal cans providing ")
  #line-at(313.2pt, 376.2pt, "the necessary magnetic shielding. ")
  #line-at(378.96pt, 399.72pt, "III.")
  #line-at(393.6pt, 399.72pt, "R")
